CM_ BO_ 790 "Primary engine frame, 10 ms.";
CM_ SG_ 790 EngineSpeed "CONFIDENCE A (confirmed): matched byte-exact against external ground truth. Engine speed. Confirmed on the 2026-06-13 petrol capture against an OBD reading, and again on the 2026-08-20 CNG car: idle median 929 rpm against 931 on a Teltonika FMB001, with a clean 905-5386 rpm sweep in the dedicated rev capture. This pack's own capture is the 2026-06-13 petrol vehicle; The Aura CNG_2024 pack shares this bus map: these signals decode correctly on both vehicles. See docs/HYUNDAI_AURA_DECODE.md.";
CM_ BO_ 1366 "Secondary engine-speed broadcast, 10 ms.";
CM_ SG_ 1366 EngineSpeed2 "CONFIDENCE A (confirmed): matched byte-exact against external ground truth. Second engine-speed broadcast. Tracks ECM_Engine.EngineSpeed to under 1 rpm at idle and within 6 rpm across a full rev sweep. This pack's own capture is the 2026-06-13 petrol vehicle; The Aura CNG_2024 pack shares this bus map: these signals decode correctly on both vehicles. See docs/HYUNDAI_AURA_DECODE.md.";
CM_ BO_ 1456 "Odometer, 1000 ms.";
CM_ SG_ 1456 Odometer "CONFIDENCE A (confirmed): matched byte-exact against external ground truth. Odometer, 0.1 km per count. CONFIRMED BY MOTION on the CNG sibling: across a recorded drive the raw went 402419 -> 402430, i.e. 40241.9 -> 40243.0 km, and the cluster photos either side read 40241 and 40243 - the display floors to whole km, so both integers are reproduced. Note the trap: dividing the DISPLAYED 2 km by 11 counts gives a bogus 0.18 km/count. This pack's own capture is the 2026-06-13 petrol vehicle; The Aura CNG_2024 pack shares this bus map: these signals decode correctly on both vehicles. See docs/HYUNDAI_AURA_DECODE.md.";

BA_DEF_ BO_ "GenMsgCycleTime" INT 0 65535;
BA_DEF_ SG_ "SignalConfidence" ENUM "A_Confirmed","B_Corroborated","C_Inferred";
BA_DEF_DEF_ "GenMsgCycleTime" 0;
BA_DEF_DEF_ "SignalConfidence" "C_Inferred";
BA_ "GenMsgCycleTime" BO_ 790 10;
BA_ "GenMsgCycleTime" BO_ 1366 10;
BA_ "GenMsgCycleTime" BO_ 1456 1000;
BA_ "SignalConfidence" SG_ 790 EngineSpeed 0;
BA_ "SignalConfidence" SG_ 1366 EngineSpeed2 0;
BA_ "SignalConfidence" SG_ 1456 Odometer 0;

